    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d570">

                <pb facs="0559" n="547" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg547"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.51A/872: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-10-22T22:00:00-04:00">October 22,
                            1943—10 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>544. We think that agreements for Military and <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gendarmerie</hi> missions should be included in pending matters demanding
                    immediate attention listed in your 1007, October 19.</p>
                <pb facs="0560" n="548" xml:id="pg548"/>
                <p>McDonnell yesterday declined to accept position of pharmaceutical director. We
                    will try to find another man promptly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
